---
description: Use the project SPEC workflow
alwaysApply: true
---

This Unity project uses the SPEC workflow maintained under `Documents/`.

Before feature work, bug fixes, scene changes, asset/config changes, or behavior changes:

1. Read `Documents/SPEC_WORKFLOW.md`.
2. Read `Documents/SPEC_STATUS.md`.
3. Follow the workflow and current `Next Action` unless the user gives a newer instruction.

After code, scene, asset, or configuration changes, update `Documents/SPEC_STATUS.md` in the same turn with progress, checks, and next action. Keep static project information in `Documents/PROJECT_SETUP.md`.

For read-only investigation or simple questions, do not update SPEC status unless requested.
